            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>One embodiment of the present disclosure provides a semiconductor package including a bottom chip package (10) having a first side (10a) and a second side (10b) opposing the first side (10a) , and a top antenna package (20) mounted on the first side (10a) of the bottom chip package (10). The bottom chip package (10) further includes a semiconductor chip (30). The semiconductor chip (30) may include a RFIC chip. The top antenna package (20) has at least one radiative antenna element (220).</p>
